    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8455d2982664ef0dd8121c7ea9ce7a5c.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8455d2982664ef0dd8121c7ea9ce7a5c.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8455d2982664ef0dd8121c7ea9ce7a5c.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET YOUR BODY BACK</h2></strong><br>You are a former pirate king who was defeated in a battle with the sea devil. Waking up in the \u201c<i>Endless Bay</i>\u201d you will find the power that will allow you to take revenge and regain control of the sea for yourself.<br>Become a vengeful spirit, inhabit enemy ships, use an immortal crew, learn deadly spells to set your own rules of the game in this sea!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLES ON THE HIGH SEAS</h2></strong><br>Knock down the sails and board? Hole the hull and drown it? Perhaps you want to curse the team, instill panic in them, or capture their souls? Everything is possible in the world <i>Bottle of Ghouls</i>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/cb9325a38e841369d7cd301841c23f49.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/cb9325a38e841369d7cd301841c23f49.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/cb9325a38e841369d7cd301841c23f49.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCHANGING SOULS FOR NEW ABILITIES</h2></strong><br>A powerful patron will allow you to gain abilities that provide a turning point during the battle! But in exchange for, he will ask <i>more souls</i>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/896b1fe564bca6177ac45934030580e6.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=308 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANDOM EVENTS AND A UNIQUE JOURNEY</h2></strong><br>The <i>Roguelike</i> elements will not let you get bored. New enemies, new allies, powerful spells and mountains of gold! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/9c1426b7720a6d05a6e82544ef73dd73.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=308 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE THE COMMAND</h2></strong><br>Your team is a crowd of ghouls and the dead! Upgrade your skills, collect artifacts and conquer this world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8493b9f5b33d714a966995aa02733248.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8493b9f5b33d714a966995aa02733248.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8493b9f5b33d714a966995aa02733248.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>What awaits you beyond the horizon?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8455d2982664ef0dd8121c7ea9ce7a5c.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8455d2982664ef0dd8121c7ea9ce7a5c.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8455d2982664ef0dd8121c7ea9ce7a5c.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET YOUR BODY BACK</h2></strong><br>You are a former pirate king who was defeated in a battle with the sea devil. Waking up in the \u201c<i>Endless Bay</i>\u201d you will find the power that will allow you to take revenge and regain control of the sea for yourself.<br>Become a vengeful spirit, inhabit enemy ships, use an immortal crew, learn deadly spells to set your own rules of the game in this sea!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLES ON THE HIGH SEAS</h2></strong><br>Knock down the sails and board? Hole the hull and drown it? Perhaps you want to curse the team, instill panic in them, or capture their souls? Everything is possible in the world <i>Bottle of Ghouls</i>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/cb9325a38e841369d7cd301841c23f49.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/cb9325a38e841369d7cd301841c23f49.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/cb9325a38e841369d7cd301841c23f49.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCHANGING SOULS FOR NEW ABILITIES</h2></strong><br>A powerful patron will allow you to gain abilities that provide a turning point during the battle! But in exchange for, he will ask <i>more souls</i>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/896b1fe564bca6177ac45934030580e6.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=308 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANDOM EVENTS AND A UNIQUE JOURNEY</h2></strong><br>The <i>Roguelike</i> elements will not let you get bored. New enemies, new allies, powerful spells and mountains of gold! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/9c1426b7720a6d05a6e82544ef73dd73.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=308 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE THE COMMAND</h2></strong><br>Your team is a crowd of ghouls and the dead! Upgrade your skills, collect artifacts and conquer this world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8493b9f5b33d714a966995aa02733248.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8493b9f5b33d714a966995aa02733248.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/8493b9f5b33d714a966995aa02733248.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>What awaits you beyond the horizon?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1715755110\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669510/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1715755110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
